C ELM15A              TYPE 15   UNITS CHANGES
C
C UNITI(14)    CONVERSION UNITS FOR INPUT
C UNITO(14)    CONVERSION UNITS FOR OUTPUT
C USIZE        CONVERSION FACTOR FOR UNITS FROM DATA
C MPMAD        TRUE IF MAD CONVENTION IS USED FOR MULTIPOLES
C
      LOGICAL         MPMAD
      REAL            UNITI(14), UNITO(14), USIZE
C
      COMMON /ELM15A/ UNITI, UNITO, USIZE, MPMAD
